launches. Each is a trademark of its owner; Condr uses them nominatively, recolored to
`currentColor` so the theme tints them like every other icon, and otherwise
geometrically unchanged unless noted. Fetched on 2026-09-15. The agent marks live in
assets/agents/ with their own NOTICE.

